ink I can teach you much more<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell you what. I know a great teauner who lives in an island called Patch. Let's get you out of here and I'll take you to him&quot; <br /> <br /> There's more to this idea if anyone wants to hear it. Hell, anyone know a good fan artist who might make it into a comic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 12-19-2020, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-14T03:03:00-08:00","id":1428329,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Episode 6 reaffirmed my idea that while Cinder would make a great Abyssal or Infernal, she's probably a BIT closer to Infernal, thematically.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-14T21:27:40-08:00","id":1428434,"title":"","content":"Anyone else thinking of AU's where Cinder's origin turns out better too?<br /> <br /> And speaking of, if she had gone on to become a proper huntress, what king of outfit would she have adopted? The stuff we saw in V2&amp;3? Or something else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 12-19-2020, 08:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-15T01:02:48-08:00","id":1428443,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I've seen many people planning on it, including at least one prompt where one of the living members of Team STRQ stop by the hotel.<br /> <br /> Which would be kind of hilarious if it was like, Taiyang.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, girls! This is Cinder, she's your new sister. Also I can never go to Atlas ever again and it may be a good idea if you don't either. No I won't tell you why.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-15T13:53:08-08:00","id":1428505,"title":"","content":"It seems a lot involve Cinder moving in with the Xiao Long clan. I have one like that too<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ruby</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">AHHHHHHHHHHHHH! New Sister!!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Another: Qrow checks in at the Glass Unicorn. Raven uses this as a chance to tp in and rob the place. takes Cinder with her on her way out<br /> <br /> <br /> I hope when the grimm horde sacks Atlas we do see them wreck that hotel though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 12-19-2020, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T03:21:20-08:00","id":1429004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1426878#post1426878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would Aura-users be roughly akin to what 2e considered to be Enlightened Mortals?</div> </div> </div> </div>My instinct would be no.<br /> If Enlightened Mortals could be said to have had a defining feature it was that despite whatever power was available to them, they were fragile compared to native essence users. In contrast to this, aura-users tend to absorb direct hits in a way that would be impressive to Exalts not focused on Resistance/Stamina.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T03:29:51-08:00","id":1429005,"title":"","content":"Aura users would be god bloods or dragon blooded. This setting has nothing like Celestial Exalts.....well, ok, it does but only 2","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T14:56:55-08:00","id":1429072,"title":"","content":"Right.<br /> <br /> Pietro Polendina is a Dragon-Blooded who clearly has power, given his genius and the Aura (Essence) he was able to sacrifice to bring Penny to life, but he\u2019s never learned how to use his powers for survival or combat. So, no Resistance Charms, like all of the combatants of this show have.<br /> <br /> Cinder Exalted with her steam-brush moment that caught Rhodes\u2019 attention, but Exaltation alone isn\u2019t that big a deal on Remnant. Heck, her \u201cstep-mother\u201d might have been \u201cExalted\u201d as well, but untrained in combat. Cinder herself didn\u2019t actually become dangerous until Rhodes trained her to fight.<br /> <br /> Likewise, Ruby and Yang needed their training at combat schools before they were ready for Beacon Academy. Jaune, who was denied combat training by his parents, had the talent but lacked the skill until taught by Pyrrha Nikos, and still lags behind his peers.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Schnee and Arc dynasties reliably produce Huntsmen-level warriors (at least for children who are willing and allowed to attend combat school), the Rose-Xiao-Long-Branwen clan did the same.<br /> <br /> Ren and Nora were Lost Eggs. We still don\u2019t know about Nora\u2019s parents, but Ren\u2019s father explicitly wasn\u2019t a Huntsmen in name or ability, and neither was his mother.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T06:42:49-08:00","id":1429140,"title":"","content":"No matter which Ability-based Exalt you built Yang as, she would Favor Resistance.<br /> <br /> If you were to try to build Yang Xiao-Long as a Solar, you would definitely use Brawl rather than Fire Dragon Style. It wouldn\u2019t even be a question.<br /> <br /> If you were to try building Yang Xiao-Long as a Dragon Blood, you absolutely could not use Brawl and would need to use Fire Dragon Style.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s not simply about preserving her visual image of Fire, but the reality that Resistance\u2019s Signature Fire Charm is the closest to emulating her Semblance, and Brawl\u2019s Signature Water Charm is far from it, and both Charms are completely incompatible.<br /> <br /> Making her an Earth Aspect is a compromise. The Earth Signature Charms for Brawl and Resistance are adjacent to Yang Xiao-Long\u2019s \u201cplay style\u201d, but not the most evocative of it.<br /> <br /> At least Ember Celica is a pair of bracers rather than knuckle-dusters, so they\u2019re still compatible with Fire Dragon Style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T13:41:26-08:00","id":1429228,"title":"","content":"I wrote up an artifact Red Riding Hood cloak based on Ruby and her ever-present fashion statement and Semblance.<br /> <br /> The <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1174032-rose-reaper-s-cloak-demonic-red-jade-artifact-4\">Rose Reaper\u2019s Cloak</a>, resonant with Solars, Terrestrials, Infernals, and Abyssals. Has some slight synergy with White Reaper Style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T13:53:33-08:00","id":1429413,"title":"","content":"Well, I was hoping the midseason hiatus would be fan artists imagining HuntressCinder from a happier time line.<br /> <br /> Instead we're discussing what happened to Yang when Raven transformed while pregnant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T17:37:44-08:00","id":1429441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1429413#post1429413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I was hoping the midseason hiatus would be fan artists imagining HuntressCinder from a happier time line.<br /> <br /> Instead we're discussing what happened to Yang when Raven transformed while pregnant.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've seen some fanart of the former, including some fanart of Modern Cinder rescuing Kid Cinder.<br /> <br /> And saw a cute fanfic, where Team STRQ arrives at the hotel. It's on Archive of our Own under the title &quot;The Gang Kidnaps a Child&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{