code_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1429699#post1429699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, anyone know Chinese? I'm trying to think of names for their daughter if AUCinder married Taiyang....<br /> <br /> <br /> En-Tai-er Team!</div> </div> </div> </div>I do. What about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T21:18:32-08:00","id":1429711,"title":"","content":"I'm trying to think of something fire related to go in front of Xiao Long. Any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T21:36:15-08:00","id":1429713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1429711#post1429711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying to think of something fire related to go in front of Xiao Long. Any ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is Huo (fire)<br /> Re (warm, heat, hot)<br /> <br /> Let's see... <br /> Taiyang = big sun. <br /> Yang = Sun<br /> <br /> Flames..... <br /> <br /> Well, dragons are used. What abou phoenixes? <br /> <br /> FengHuang is phoenix<br /> Feng = male, Huang = Female, but they've basically merged. <br /> <br /> How about Huang? <br /> <br /> And as a bonus, Huang also means 'yellow&quot;, and give her blonde hair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T23:44:48-08:00","id":1429718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1429699#post1429699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, anyone know Chinese? I'm trying to think of names for their daughter if AUCinder married Taiyang....<br /> <br /> <br /> En-Tai-er Team!</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that Cinder may be closer in age to Yang and Ruby than she is to Taiyang, but that's mostly gut instinct more than anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-24T03:03:50-08:00","id":1429730,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1429713#post1429713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is Huo (fire)<br /> Re (warm, heat, hot)<br /> <br /> Let's see...<br /> Taiyang = big sun.<br /> Yang = Sun<br /> <br /> Flames.....<br /> <br /> Well, dragons are used. What abou phoenixes?<br /> <br /> FengHuang is phoenix<br /> Feng = male, Huang = Female, but they've basically merged.<br /> <br /> How about Huang?<br /> <br /> And as a bonus, Huang also means 'yellow&quot;, and give her blonde hair.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmm, another daughter who's basically her mom with Tai's hair color?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-24T03:05:51-08:00","id":1429731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1426200-rwby-volume-8-thread?p=1429718#post1429718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think that Cinder may be closer in age to Yang and Ruby than she is to Taiyang, but that's mostly gut instinct more than anything.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't think we have canon ages, but my headcanon is Cinder is 25 while Tai is 39-41. So yeah closer to Yang (who is canonically 19 I believe), but not an unreasonable age difference. They're adults after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-16T01:28:40-08:00","id":1432387,"title":"","content":"Still a few weeks off from the end of the hiatus, but I thought this was pretty interesting when it came to the secondary material<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.gamesradar.com/rooster-teeth-hit-rwby-crossing-over-with-the-justice-league/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/q2PvxAxBuNKzHUaNjLx2FC-1280-80.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.gamesradar.com/rooster-teeth-hit-rwby-crossing-over-with-the-justice-league/\" target=\"_blank\"> Rooster Teeth hit RWBY crossing over with the Justice League </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.gamesradar.com/rooster-teeth-hit-rwby-crossing-over-with-the-justice-league/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.gamesradar.com/rooster-teeth-hit-rwby-crossing-over-with-the-justice-league/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Introducing an all-new version of Batman, Wonder Woman, and Superman </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Basically, they're doing a non canonical cross over between RWBY and Justice League...but it's a fusion fic rather than an alternate dimension business. Not sure what I think about that. When it comes to properties like this crossing over I'd much rather it be the actual versions interacting with each other rather than a pseudo fusion. It does make me wonder about 2021 though, since Volume 9 is supposed to come out this year along with a RWBY video game by Wayforward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26024-distant-choir","name":"Distant Choir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26024_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-06T21:24:19-08:00","id":1434729,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">So the hound was a person to no one's surprise. Now, did it have a canid-form because he was a dog faunus? Could another species faunus make something different? What about a human? Or did Salem make it like that? <br /> <br /> You know, I wanted to do something where Infernals made their mortal followers like that. How to do that mechanically in 3E<br /> <br /> Btw, anyone else think for a second that was Raven busting Qrow our?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-08T00:09:22-08:00","id":1434818,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;ma